    "name": "Green Empire",
    "steam_appid": 3216070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/ef8ef9a01f1212b15ab30a96abe4b752.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Empire</strong> is an Isometric view Action roguelike RPG set in the most endangered environments of our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the last polar bear and set out on an epic journey across Earth\u2019s most threatened habitats with one quest: fight environmental disasters and climate change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/23e675eec90c5b4835f234f5724ec292.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the world through infinitely replayable scenarios battling to save Earth\u2019s most threatened habitats.<br>The game\u2019s mechanics are designed to mirror real-world environmental challenges on both local and global scales. Your actions in each map ripple outward, affecting the planet as a whole. Global warming evolves dynamically, influencing future maps and raising the stakes as you fight to restore balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/945610a0be55e3a124f30fbde96232e2.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in an ongoing struggle to restore our planet's ecosystems. Face environmental challenges unique to each country like deforestation, poaching or pollution. Take a stance  against the powerful corporations exploiting the natural resources\u00a0and\u00a0use different strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/72f38a54327e3132ec69046a5b11c71c.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Empire\u00a0</strong>currently features a thrilling survival mode where every step challenges your strategy. Unlock new countries as you advance, each with unique environmental crises, tougher maps, and powerful corporations to confront. Adapt to evolving objectives and escalating challenges in your fight to protect the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME THAT GIVES BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/43c5d0b093de10524e198bbacd2313b1.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of <strong>Green Empire</strong> future profits will be donated to real-world environmental organizations working to protect the very habitats featured in the game. When you  support Green Empire, you\u2019re helping protect our planet \u2014 inside the game and out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for our survival.<br>Play for change.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/ef8ef9a01f1212b15ab30a96abe4b752.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Empire</strong> is an Isometric view Action roguelike RPG set in the most endangered environments of our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the last polar bear and set out on an epic journey across Earth\u2019s most threatened habitats with one quest: fight environmental disasters and climate change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/23e675eec90c5b4835f234f5724ec292.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the world through infinitely replayable scenarios battling to save Earth\u2019s most threatened habitats.<br>The game\u2019s mechanics are designed to mirror real-world environmental challenges on both local and global scales. Your actions in each map ripple outward, affecting the planet as a whole. Global warming evolves dynamically, influencing future maps and raising the stakes as you fight to restore balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/945610a0be55e3a124f30fbde96232e2.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in an ongoing struggle to restore our planet's ecosystems. Face environmental challenges unique to each country like deforestation, poaching or pollution. Take a stance  against the powerful corporations exploiting the natural resources\u00a0and\u00a0use different strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/72f38a54327e3132ec69046a5b11c71c.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Empire\u00a0</strong>currently features a thrilling survival mode where every step challenges your strategy. Unlock new countries as you advance, each with unique environmental crises, tougher maps, and powerful corporations to confront. Adapt to evolving objectives and escalating challenges in your fight to protect the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME THAT GIVES BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216070/extras/43c5d0b093de10524e198bbacd2313b1.avif?t=1747924288\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of <strong>Green Empire</strong> future profits will be donated to real-world environmental organizations working to protect the very habitats featured in the game. When you  support Green Empire, you\u2019re helping protect our planet \u2014 inside the game and out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for our survival.<br>Play for change.</p>",
